    'MEMBER', 'From an engineering perspective, optimizing RAGE for 2 fixed console SKUs with unified memory is 10x easier than dealing with 5,000 PC hardware combinations, DirectX 12 Agility SDK shader compilation, and anti-tamper. But the financial incentive is 100% the primary driver.', 95, 1790755066869
